"If you use robot_usds **outside** FaSim, put `environment/fiveages_env` "
"next to `robots/` so scene USDs can reference it. `fa-project-usd` is a "
"project scene tree, not a public robot model. Product names on this page "
"follow the public robot_usds gallery text. Keep camera rigs in the scene "
"USD."
msgstr "不要把私有项目 USD 当成公开机器人模型，也不要写本章所依据的公开 robot_usds gallery 文本里没有的产品代号。"

